<template id="bag-content"><div class="bag-panel-head"><p class="label" id="bag-panel-title">Added to your bag</p><button type="button" class="bag-panel-close" aria-label="Close" data-close>×</button></div><div class="bag-panel-item"><img alt="" width="72" height="90"><p><strong></strong><span></span><span></span></p></div><p class="bag-panel-total"><span></span><strong></strong></p><p class="bag-panel-arrival"></p><a class="button bag-panel-checkout" href="/checkout/">Checkout </a><button type="button" class="text-button" data-close>Keep shopping</button></template>
<template id="photo-content"><button type="button" class="photo-viewer-close" aria-label="Close">×</button><div class="photo-viewer-frame"><img alt=""></div></template>
<template id="fit-content"><form method="dialog" class="fit-form"><div class="fit-head"><h2 id="fit-title">Find your size</h2><button type="button" class="bag-panel-close" aria-label="Close" data-fit-close>×</button></div><p>Lay a top that fits you well flat. Measure straight across the chest, an inch below the armholes, and from the top of the shoulder to the hem.</p><div class="fit-fields"><label>Chest width <span>inches</span><input name="chest" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="12" max="40" step="0.25" required></label><label>Body length <span>inches</span><input name="length" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="16" max="40" step="0.25" required></label></div><p class="fit-result" role="status" data-fit-result></p><div class="fit-actions"><button type="submit" class="button">Show my size </button><button type="button" class="button button-secondary" data-fit-select hidden></button><button type="button" class="text-button" data-fit-forget hidden>Forget my measurements</button></div><p class="fit-privacy">Saved only in this browser.</p></form></template>
